===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Audino|177}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*'''Do the Wave''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Jungle|Wigglytuff|16}} from the {{TCG|Jungle}} expansion.
